<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Paperlane Studio</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Palatino Linotype", serif;
      color: #2e241c;
      background: #f4ecdf;
    }
    .wrap {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 72px 24px;
    }
    .chip {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border: 1px solid #2e241c;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 86px); margin: 18px 0; }
    p { max-width: 620px; line-height: 1.8; color: #5b4e43; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="chip">Paperlane Studio</div>
    <h1>Quiet infrastructure for editorial-grade delivery.</h1>
    <p>Publishing, routing and edge-facing delivery surfaces designed for controlled rollout, managed access and stable distribution.</p>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
